<% if(locals.uploadPolicy){ const policy=uploadPolicy,n=value=>value===null?'Unlimited':Number(value).toLocaleString('en-US'); %>
<section class="setup-plan-allowance" aria-label="Your plan's import allowance"><h3><%= policy.planName %> import allowance</h3><p>Both checks below apply: the file must fit the upload size, and its records must fit your plan.</p><h4>Records and AI included in your plan</h4><dl><% for(const [key,label] of [['products','Products'],['active_skus','SKUs'],['agent_documents','AI document readings this month'],['ai_work_credits','AI credits this month']]){const meter=policy.meters.find(m=>m.meter===key);if(meter){ %><div><dt><%= label %></dt><dd><strong><%= n(meter.remaining) %></strong><%= meter.remaining===null?'':' remaining' %><% if(meter.hardLimit!==null){ %> of <%= n(meter.hardLimit) %><% } %></dd></div><% }} %></dl><% const rows=policy.meters.find(m=>m.meter==='import_rows');if(rows?.hardLimit!==null&&rows?.hardLimit!==undefined){ %><p>Up to <strong><%= n(rows.hardLimit) %> rows per import</strong>. Product and SKU totals include records already in this account.</p><% } %><h4>Maximum file sizes</h4><p>Spreadsheets and text: <strong><%= Math.floor(policy.maxBytes/1048576) %> MB</strong>. Images: <strong><%= Math.floor(policy.imageBytes/1048576) %> MB</strong>, <%= policy.imagePages %> pages and <%= Math.floor(policy.imagePixels/1000000) %> megapixels in total. PDFs: <strong><%= Math.floor(policy.pdfBytes/1048576) %> MB</strong> and <%= policy.pdfPages %> pages. These size limits do not increase your plan’s record allowance.</p><p>Handwritten sheets: <strong><%= policy.handwriting?'Included on your plan':'Growth or higher' %></strong>. AI readings use your current document and credit allowances, including active packs. Typed tables can be read without AI.</p><a href="/settings/billing">View plan and usage</a></section><% } %>
